    <Major>Bloodletter combo </Major>
    <Description>BLOODLETTER COMBO Q -W -E 30LVL

How to use: Download the script assign it to a hotkey of your choice go in game pick up a bloodletter
find an enemy press the hotkey the combo will unleash

Any bloodletter Tier will work as soon as you have spec 30 on it








What is a macro:   Macros help gamers simplify the chaotic control requirements by reducing sequences to the push of a button. It simplifies the input as a single button can perform a sequence of actions. They can be used for doing regular, mundane, or complex tasks without requiring repetitive keystrokes



Can you get banned in game: no, as soon as you run the programm in incognito mod it makes it impossible to detect any illegal action



